### 1. Registar Utilizador (Sucesso -> incrementa user_registrations_total{status="success"})
POST http://localhost:8080/micrometer/register-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marcos Lacroix",
  "email": "marcos@example.com"
}

### 2. Registar Utilizador Inválido (Falha -> incrementa user_registrations_total{status="failure"})
POST http://localhost:8080/micrometer/register-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "teste",
  "email": "teste@gmail.com"
}

### 3. Executar Cálculo Pesado de Impostos (Timer -> business_tax_calculation_time_seconds)
GET http://localhost:8080/micrometer/heavy-calculations
Accept: application/json

### 4. Simular Erro HTTP 500 (5xx -> dispara alerta > 2% em 5m no Grafana)
GET http://localhost:8080/micrometer/simulate-5xx
Accept: application/json

### 5. Alocar Blocos de Bytes na Memória (10 MB)
GET http://localhost:8080/alloc/bytes?mb=10
Accept: application/json

### 6. Alocar Objetos no HashMap (Pressão no GC)
GET http://localhost:8080/alloc/objects?items=200000
Accept: application/json

### 7. Consultar Métricas Expostas no Prometheus (Actuator)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

### 8. Consultar Health Check (inclui customServiceHealth)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 9. Publicar Evento Customizado no Kafka (tópico: observability-events-topic)
POST http://localhost:8080/kafka/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "order-123",
  "message": "Evento de teste enviado para o Apache Kafka com tracing OpenTelemetry"
}

### 10. Consultar Eventos Consumidos pelo Kafka Consumer (Utilizadores + Eventos Customizados)
GET http://localhost:8080/kafka/consumed
Accept: application/json
